From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:20:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] accel/ane: sync the ANE driver with aurora integration/aurora

Bring drivers/accel/ane, its uapi header, the apple,ane binding, its
documentation, ABI files and selftests to aurora-silicon/linux
integration/aurora 50d5865ea6dc4dcee27fb2623a70da35fcef0e54 (fetched 2026-11-08):
the H16 (M4 family, apple,t6041-ane) and H17 (A18 Pro, apple,t8140-ane)
firmware platforms with preload validation, the shared firmware ring
transport, cold boot and sleep cycling, program loading and the
pending/execute path, on top of the t8103/t6000/t6020/t6021/t6022/t8112
driver this base has. After this commit every one of these files equals
integration/aurora byte for byte.

The 131 upstream commits below are not picked one by one: they sit on
parallel Aurora branches whose topological order conflicts on shared
Kconfig, Makefile and documentation lines at the 22nd pick, and this base
has no local change to any of these files since the 7.2.10 merge base
(44d5afc79d), so the end state is exact. Their
non-ANE prerequisites come as their own commits before this one:
the pick of 06c0dfac69 (34458f93d5, apple_pmgr_ps_cycle), the
clpc ANE floor pick of 7801f81ca0, and the pmp-report ANE hook
declaration (absent channel). Hunks of the listed commits outside these
paths (other SoCs' DTS, pmdomain pmp-report.c/pmp-ane, apple-dart, drm,
MAINTAINERS, tools/asahi) are not taken.

